<title>SINGAPORE: Teledata switches to Singapore mainboard.</title>
<headline>Teledata switches to Singapore mainboard.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teledata (Singapore) Ltd said on Tuesday the Stock Exchange of Singapore has approved its transfer to the main board from the secondary board, SESDAQ.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the transfer will be effective July 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
